---
title: Section 2 — Candidate Recall Check
---
flowchart TD
  PAIRS["<b>candidate_pairs.tsv</b>"]
  GT["<b>GROUND TRUTH</b><br/>Known correct mappings<br/><code>S1-001 → S2-104 ✓</code>"]
  CHECK1{"<b>GROUND TRUTH CHECK #1</b><br/>Candidate Recall Check<br/>Is the true pair present in candidate_pairs.tsv?"}
  SUFF["<b>Candidate generation is sufficient</b><br/>→ continue to pairwise features"]
  MISSING["<b>True pair missing</b><br/>recall ceiling lowered permanently"]
  IMPROVEB["<b>Improve blocking / filtering</b>"]
  REGEN["<b>Regenerate candidate_pairs_v2.tsv</b>"]
  NOTE["<b>IMPORTANT</b><br/>Ground truth NEVER deletes candidates.<br/>It only answers <i>was the true pair retrieved?</i><br/>ALL candidates stay available to the model."]
  PAIRS --> CHECK1
  GT --> CHECK1
  CHECK1 -->|YES| SUFF
  CHECK1 -->|NO| MISSING --> IMPROVEB --> REGEN
  REGEN -.->|"↺ back to candidate generation"| PAIRS
  SUFF -.- NOTE
  classDef file fill:#60a5fa,stroke:#1e3a5f,color:#12283f
  classDef decision fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f
  classDef ok fill:#a7f3d0,stroke:#047857,color:#065f46
  classDef err fill:#fecaca,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d
  classDef warn fill:#fed7aa,stroke:#c2410c,color:#7c2d12
  classDef note fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#065f46
  class PAIRS file
  class CHECK1 decision
  class GT,SUFF ok
  class MISSING err
  class IMPROVEB,REGEN warn
  class NOTE note
